FINGER(1)

NAME
     finger - show details about a user

SYNOPSIS
     finger [user ...]

DESCRIPTION
     With a name, shows the real name behind that account, its home
     directory, its last login, and the note its owner keeps in a file
     called .plan.

     With no name, lists everyone logged in right now.

EXAMPLES
     finger marge

SEE ALSO
     who(1), last(1)
